/P 8483 0 R
/T (Analysis of endpoint traffic and database queries indicated a strong bias toward read operations. This validates the decision to optimize for fast data retrieval, with Redis acting as a high-speed layer for leaderboard data, preference states, and simulation results.)
/E (Analysis of endpoint traffic and database queries indicated a strong bias toward read operations. This validates the decision to optimize for fast data retrieval, with Redis acting as a high-speed layer for leaderboard data, preference states, and simulation results.)
