/E (We use Uptime Kuma as a lightweight, self-hosted monitoring tool to track the availability of critical endpoints and services. It performs periodic health checks via HTTP, TCP, and WebSocket protocols, and triggers alerts on downtime or latency spikes. Grafana complements this by visualizing uptime trends, alert history, and service health metrics.)
